:: the pool

<p> </p>
      <video width="320" height="240" controls autoplay>
  <source src="src/assets/video/sam's poor man's sound effects/walking in water.mp4" type="video/mp4">
</video>

the water is frigidly cold, with each step it swallows you further. you've lost track of dry ground. 

[[reach into the water|reach]]
[[keep walking | keep walking]]

:: keep walking
<p> </p>
      <video width="320" height="240" controls autoplay>
  <source src="src/assets/video/sam's poor man's sound effects/walking in water.mp4" type="video/mp4">
</video>

it's as dark and cold and miserable. 

[[reach into the water | reach]]
[[keep walking| keep walking]]

:: reach

your hand reaches into the freezing water, and finds nothing. no fish. no plant life. nothing.

[[reach further| reach 2]]

:: reach 2
you are elbow deep into the water. it's cold and smooth and you know the oils of your skin are ruining this natural envrioment. 
but still.. nothing

[[reach even further|reach 3]]

your finger tips then hands, then elbow then upper arm, and then all the way up to your shoulder. 
you strain to keep your head above the surface, the water laps at your collorbone, and you just barely scrape the bottom of the pool.
your hands find something solid. some kind of rock?

you bring it up to your ear and tap your nail against it. 

a
[[listen]]

:: listen
  <video width="320" height="240" controls autoplay>
  <source src="src/assets/video/sam's poor man's sound effects/crystal sound effect.mp4" type="video/mp4">
</video>

it's a gem. 

[[you're free to go|go home]]

:: go home
<video width="320" height="240" controls autoplay>
  <source src="src/assets/video/sam's poor man's sound effects/walking in water.mp4" type="video/mp4">
</video>
 the gem is a pleasant weight in your hand. you pick a direction, and trust eventually you'll make it to dry land.

